     "created_at": "2026-04-10T19:52:07Z",
     "updated_at": "2026-04-10T19:52:07Z",
     "body": "At this time, the team plans to deliver database segregation, just as in the ODS/API v7 in the relational database. For streaming data, where there is a single `Document` table per tenant's database, use separate topics per tenant / instance.\n\nFor more background on, see [this analysis](https://github.com/Ed-Fi-Alliance-OSS/Project-Tanager/blob/main/docs/DMS/MULTITENANCY/ANALYSIS.md). (Note: the analysis still refers to OpenSearch, which has been removed from the solution. Ignore all comments about OpenSearch).",
